---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import RelatedTools from "../../components/RelatedTools.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="법정 연차일수 & 연차수당 계산기"
  description="근로기준법 제60조에 따른 근속연수별 법정 연차유급휴가 발생 일수와 미사용 연차유급휴가 정산 수당을 실시간 정밀 모의계산합니다."
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-3 inline-block">← 전체 도구 목록</a>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
        근로기준법 제60조 및 제61조 공식 적용
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">
        법정 연차일수 & 연차수당 계산기
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        근속 연수에 따라 법적으로 부여되는 연차휴가 일수를 확인하고, 연도 말 또는 퇴사 시 정산받는 미사용 연차수당을 통상임금 기준으로 계산합니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-xs space-y-6">
      <!-- 근속연수 입력 -->
      <div>
        <label for="years-service" class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground">근속 연수 (만 근무 연수)</label>
        <div class="mt-2 relative">
          <input
            type="number"
            id="years-service"
            value="1"
            min="0"
            max="40"
            step="1"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
          />
          <span class="absolute right-4 top-3.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground">년</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">1년 미만: 0년 입력 (1개월 개근 시 1일씩 최대 11일 발생)</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 시급 및 일 근로시간 -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div>
          <label for="hourly-wage" class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground">통상시급 (원)</label>
          <div class="mt-2 relative">
            <input
              type="number"
              id="hourly-wage"
              value="10030"
              step="100"
              min="10030"
              class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            />
            <span class="absolute right-4 top-3.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground">원</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">2026 최저시급 10,030원</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="daily-hours" class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground">1일 소정근로시간</label>
          <select
            id="daily-hours"
            class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
          >
            <option value="8" selected>8시간 (기본 전일제)</option>
            <option value="7">7시간</option>
            <option value="6">6시간</option>
            <option value="5">5시간</option>
            <option value="4">4시간 (단시간 근로)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 미사용 연차일수 -->
      <div>
        <label for="unused-days" class="block text-xs font-bold text-foreground">미사용 잔여 연차일수</label>
        <div class="mt-2 relative">
          <input
            type="number"
            id="unused-days"
            value="5"
            min="0"
            max="30"
            step="0.5"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
          />
          <span class="absolute right-4 top-3.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground">일</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">연차유급휴가 사용촉진조치가 없는 경우 미사용분에 대해 금전 정산 의무 발생</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 결과 상자 -->
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="text-center pb-4 border-b border-border/60">
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground">예상 미사용 연차정산 수당</span>
          <div class="mt-1 flex items-baseline justify-center gap-1">
            <span id="res-allowance" class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary font-mono sm:text-4xl">0</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">원</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            법정 발생 연차: <strong id="res-statutory-days" class="font-bold text-foreground font-mono">0일</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between font-medium text-muted-foreground">
            <span>1일 통상임금 (1일 분 지급 기준)</span>
            <span id="res-daily-wage" class="font-mono text-foreground font-bold">0원</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between font-medium text-muted-foreground">
            <span>정산 대상 미사용 일수</span>
            <span id="res-target-days" class="font-mono text-foreground font-bold">0일</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-primary pt-2 border-t border-border/60">
            <span>산출식</span>
            <span id="res-formula" class="font-mono text-[11px]">0원 × 0일</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- B2A API 안내 -->
      <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        <p class="font-medium text-foreground">api.oiyo.net B2A 무비용 연동 엔드포인트:</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] bg-muted p-2 rounded border border-border break-all">
          GET https://api.oiyo.net/v1/labor/kr/annual-leave?yearsOfService=1&unusedDays=5
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 p-4 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground">
      근거 법령: 근로기준법 제60조 (연차유급휴가) 및 제61조 (연차유급휴가의 사용 촉진). 1년 이상 근무 시 15일 기본 부여, 3년차부터 매 2년마다 1일씩 가산되어 최대 25일까지 발생합니다.
    </div>

    <RelatedTools currentId="annual-leave" />

    <script>
      const yearsInput = document.getElementById("years-service") as HTMLInputElement;
      const hourlyWageInput = document.getElementById("hourly-wage") as HTMLInputElement;
      const dailyHoursSelect = document.getElementById("daily-hours") as HTMLSelectElement;
      const unusedDaysInput = document.getElementById("unused-days") as HTMLInputElement;

      const resAllowance = document.getElementById("res-allowance")!;
      const resStatutoryDays = document.getElementById("res-statutory-days")!;
      const resDailyWage = document.getElementById("res-daily-wage")!;
      const resTargetDays = document.getElementById("res-target-days")!;
      const resFormula = document.getElementById("res-formula")!;

      function formatWon(num: number) {
        return Math.floor(num).toLocaleString("ko-KR") + "원";
      }

      function calculate() {
        const years = Math.max(0, parseInt(yearsInput.value, 10) || 0);
        const wage = Math.max(10030, parseFloat(hourlyWageInput.value) || 10030);
        const hours = Math.max(1, Math.min(8, parseFloat(dailyHoursSelect.value) || 8));
        const unused = Math.max(0, parseFloat(unusedDaysInput.value) || 0);

        let statutoryDays = 0;
        if (years < 1) {
          statutoryDays = 11;
        } else {
          const additionalDays = Math.floor((years - 1) / 2);
          statutoryDays = Math.min(25, 15 + additionalDays);
        }

        const dailyWage = Math.floor(wage * hours);
        const allowance = Math.floor(unused * dailyWage);

        resAllowance.textContent = allowance.toLocaleString("ko-KR");
        resStatutoryDays.textContent = `${statutoryDays}일${years < 1 ? " (1년 미만 월차 합산)" : ""}`;
        resDailyWage.textContent = formatWon(dailyWage);
        resTargetDays.textContent = `${unused}일`;
        resFormula.textContent = `${dailyWage.toLocaleString("ko-KR")}원 × ${unused}일 = ${allowance.toLocaleString("ko-KR")}원`;
      }

      yearsInput.addEventListener("input", calculate);
      hourlyWageInput.addEventListener("input", calculate);
      dailyHoursSelect.addEventListener("change", calculate);
      unusedDaysInput.addEventListener("input", calculate);
      calculate();
    </script>
  </div>
</Layout>
